A luminous human silhouette in deep meditation, seated in lotus position, with seven glowing crystalline orbs ascending vertically along the spine—each radiating a distinct color of the spectrum from deep ruby red at the base through orange, golden yellow, emerald green, sapphire blue, indigo, and finally violet at the crown. The figure floats in a dreamy nocturnal bedroom setting with soft moonlight filtering through gauze curtains. Swirling, ethereal energy spirals connect each crystalline sphere, painted in Marc Chagall's signature dreamlike style with floating, weightless quality, rich jewel-toned colors bleeding into one another, and that characteristic mystical atmosphere where figures seem to drift between waking and sleeping. The background features subtle floating musical notes and gentle starlight rendered as Chagall's distinctive floating symbols, creating a sense of peaceful nocturnal healing and spiritual restoration.
